            "sid": "EZK 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisyakin anakwap a ekabila a Simeon, alowae a ŋolo alo Kide, tomyaa lowae ŋolo alo To, eruwor nen akwap a ekabila a Isakar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisyakin anakwap a ekabila a Isakar, alowae a ŋolo alo Kide, tomyaa lowae ŋolo alo To, eruwor nen akwap a ekabila a Sebulon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisyakin anakwap a ekabila a Sebulon, alowae a ŋolo alo Kide, tomyaa lowae ŋolo alo To, eruwor nen akwap a ekabila a Gad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka akisyakin anakwap a ekabila a Gad, alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap, isyakini ekukoru alo Tamar, toremokin nakipi ŋuna a Meribas-Kades, kinapakin a nen ayonae ŋina a Ijipit, kisalak Nanam Mediteranian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwap ŋin iŋes emaikina iyes tokora toruwor ŋina aŋikabilae a Isirael ka epite ŋol emaikina iyes tokoryata iŋes. Ayoŋ Ekapolon Akuj alimu ŋun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina lu eruwor ŋipukei ŋulu a etaun Yerusalem: Ewae ŋolo alo Kuju, ŋolo emaikina erae aoyau ka arwatata ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce ŋimitae ŋalipyo ŋaarei ka ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina eya nen ŋipukei ŋiuni, ŋulu elimonokinitae ŋirorwa a ŋikabilae a Isirael. Ŋolo esyaunan epuke a Ruben, ŋolo a ŋiarei epuke a Yuda ka ŋolo a ŋiuni epuke a Lepi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewae ŋolo alo Kide, ŋolo emaikina erae aoyau ka arwatata ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce ŋimitae ŋalipyo ŋaarei ka ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikan, emaikina eya nen ŋipukei ŋiuni ŋulu elimonokinitae ŋirorwa a ŋikabilae a Isirael. Ŋolo esyaunan epuke a Yosepu, ŋolo a ŋiarei epuke a Benjamin ka ŋolo a ŋiuni epuke a Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewae ŋolo alo Kwap, ŋolo emaikina erae aoyau ka arwatata ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce ŋimitae ŋalipyo ŋaarei ka ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikan, emaikina eya nen ŋipukei ŋiuni ŋulu elimonokinitae ŋirorwa a ŋikabilae a Isirael. Ŋolo esyaunan epuke ŋolo a Simeon, ŋolo a ŋiarei epuke ŋolo a Isakar ka ŋolo a ŋiuni epuke a Sebulon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewae ŋolo alo To, ŋolo emaikina erae aoyau ka arwatata ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce ŋimitae ŋalipyo ŋaarei ka ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikan, emaikina eya nen ŋipukei ŋiuni ŋulu elimonokinitae ŋirorwa a ŋikabilae a Isirael. ŋolo esyaunan epuke a Gad, ŋolo a ŋiarei epuke ka Aser ka ŋolo a ŋiuni epuke a Naputali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina alolomu a etaun irimokini cib erae ŋimitae ŋalipyo ŋakanikaomwon. Akisyakin apaki ŋin, enyarao ekiro a etaun ebe, “Eyai Ekapolon nen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
